  "content": "<h5><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jm3PCWv.png\" alt=\"\"></h5><h5><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Yh9O6WH.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 全面翻新的世界生成（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-weve-gone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes We've Gone</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geophilic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geophilic</a>）</strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 完全優化，支援光影著色器</strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 自訂 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.horizon.pics%252f39d7ccdc-f694-466a-832b-027a84051a8f%253fa%253d580%2526mime1%253dimage%2526mime2%253dpng\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">光影設定檔</a></strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 翻新的要塞與堡壘</strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 數百個全新的地城與結構（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moogs-voyager-structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Moog's Voyager Structures</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/adorabuild-structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AdoraBuild: Structures</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/formations-overworld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Formations</a>）</strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 新增頭目與生物（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-mobs-1-21-1-port\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Mobs</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bosses-of-mass-destruction\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">、</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/friends-and-foes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Friends &amp; Foes</a>）</strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 生活品質功能：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waystones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">傳送石</a>與<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xp-tome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">經驗書</a></strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 包含 1.21.2+ 內容（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanillabackport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vanilla Backport</a>）</strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-minimap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero's 小地圖</a>搭配<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeroplus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">額外功能</a></strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dragon-mounts-legacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">可騎乘的龍</a></strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 多項自訂功能提升遊戲體驗</strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 內建 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tLTC6wYcWVM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">免費世界共享</a></strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modpackindex.com%252fmodpack%252f29331%252fbetter-mc-neoforge-bmc5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">超過 320 個模組</a></strong></h5><p><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=0843bf&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a></strong></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/LfhUwM-LkZ8\" width=\"410\" height=\"230\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/a9SYvVghFlA\" width=\"410\" height=\"230\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>非官方 Minecraft 產品。未經 Mojang 或 Microsoft 批准，亦與其無關聯</strong></span></p>",
